{"id":"84509a9312e5b529","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-hyperimmune-degree-set.md","title":"超免疫度恰含超免疫集合","display":"thm-hyperimmune-degree-set — 超免疫度恰含超免疫集合","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-hyperimmune-degree-set","aliases":["43-thm-hyperimmune-degree-set"],"display":"thm-hyperimmune-degree-set — 超免疫度恰含超免疫集合","depends_on":["[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]","[[43-thm-hyperimmune-principal]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.14.5 (Kuznecov–Medvedev, Uspenskii)","source_printed_pages":"59","source_pdf_pages":"79","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-hyperimmune-degree-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-hyperimmune-degree-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hyperimmune-degree-set — 超免疫度恰含超免疫集合"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a33ab576c20ae1c1\" href=\"?note=a33ab576c20ae1c1\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-set\">43-df-hyperimmune-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a09ec8a13786db93\" href=\"?note=a09ec8a13786db93\" title=\"43-thm-hyperimmune-principal\">43-thm-hyperimmune-principal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.14.5 (Kuznecov–Medvedev, Uspenskii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"79"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"df08310d02ee0072\" href=\"?note=df08310d02ee0072\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-free\">43-df-hyperimmune-free</a> 的度性质；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a33ab576c20ae1c1\" href=\"?note=a33ab576c20ae1c1\" title=\"43-df-hyperimmune-set\">43-df-hyperimmune-set</a> 的集合性质，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)\\iff\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(B\\equiv_TA\\land\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(B)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)\\iff\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(B\\equiv_TA\\land\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(B)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>为明确编码方向，给出补全论证：取f≤_T A不可被可计算函数最终支配。用A递归选严格递增g，满足g(n)≥f(n)且g(n)模2等于χ_A(n)。令B=range(g)。由递增性B≤_T A；由B的主函数逐位取奇偶可恢复A，故A≤_T B。p_B=g不可支配，由前一引理B是超免疫集合。反向p_B≤_T B≤_T A即可。草稿原证明有量词与编码省略，本项不沿用其不充分的逐句推理。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 5.14.5 (Kuznecov–Medvedev, Uspenskii)，印刷页59，PDF页79。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-set","status":"resolved","id":"a33ab576c20ae1c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyperimmune-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-thm-hyperimmune-principal","status":"resolved","id":"a09ec8a13786db93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-thm-hyperimmune-principal]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"df08310d02ee0072","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]] 的度性质；$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-set]] 的集合性质，$\\equiv_T$ 采用 [[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyperimmune-set","status":"resolved","id":"a33ab576c20ae1c1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]] 的度性质；$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-set]] 的集合性质，$\\equiv_T$ 采用 [[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$。$\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-free]] 的度性质；$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}$ 是 [[43-df-hyperimmune-set]] 的集合性质，$\\equiv_T$ 采用 [[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hyperimmune}(A)\\iff\\exists B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(B\\equiv_TA\\land\\operatorname{HyperimmuneSet}(B)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1817,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-hyperimmune-degree-set]] — 超免疫度恰含超免疫集合"}],"outgoing":["df08310d02ee0072","a33ab576c20ae1c1","a09ec8a13786db93","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}